Olis Bahari wrote these instructions for setting up this device.

[Step 1]
Connect the device to the computer with a USB cable.

[Step 2]
Use the web-based tool to flash it.

[Step 3]
Connect the device to the Xioazhi-3B09 WiFI 

[Step 4]
IP Address is 192.168.4.1, and we must use a web browser to access it.

[Step 5]
Configure Wi-Fi, and the name and password will be saved to the device. (Fixed)

[Step 6]
To check if our Agent is connected to the Xioahi.me cloud LLL
https://xiaozhi.me/console/agents



